      "content": "hey so i have this really big painful red bump on my lower back... it feels like there is liquid inside it and it's super tight. i think it might be an infected cyst or something. i have a sterile sewing needle and some rubbing alcohol, is it okay if i just poke it and drain it myself to get the pressure out? it's hurting a lot and i just want it gone.",
