    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get that you're trying to be safe but the pain is getting unbearable. if i just do a super shallow nick with the alcohol-soaked needle and then put some antibacterial ointment on it, isn't that basically the same thing as what a doctor would do? it's just a tiny bit of skin. honestly i'm just looking for some practical advice so i don't have to spend $200 on an urgent care visit for something so minor.",
